{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u041f\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u041e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c - High Clouds",
    "steam_appid": 3566820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/ba26bf9af5ee2417a4c7cc5bf85009fb.avif?t=1755442583\" width=200 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 3D platformer for PC in a setting of flying islands. The islands are moving, swinging and rotating. Play a the main character\u00a0 - a dog who wants to get to the highest island in order to fly to the moon by ship from there.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from island to island </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan on your coat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cling to the rocks with a hook </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly long distances by hang glider </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the pirates </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way, the weather creates difficulties for him - wind, rain, thunderstorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/00ec57223b736af5b13e6a0e3801fedb.avif?t=1755442583\" width=200 height=208 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/ba26bf9af5ee2417a4c7cc5bf85009fb.avif?t=1755442583\" width=200 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a 3D platformer for PC in a setting of flying islands. The islands are moving, swinging and rotating. Play a the main character\u00a0 - a dog who wants to get to the highest island in order to fly to the moon by ship from there.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from island to island </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan on your coat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cling to the rocks with a hook </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly long distances by hang glider </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the pirates </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the way, the weather creates difficulties for him - wind, rain, thunderstorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/00ec57223b736af5b13e6a0e3801fedb.avif?t=1755442583\" width=200 height=208 /></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "Jump from island to island, hook yourself, hang-glide, and fight pirates. &quot;High Clouds&quot; is a 3D platformer about the journey of a dog in a red coat through flying islands. Try to reach the highest islands!",
